LAYOUT SKU-REC
FIELD SKU-CODE PIC X(12)
FIELD QOH PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3
FIELD UNIT-COST PIC S9(5)V999 COMP-3
FIELD STATUS-BYTE PIC X
REDEFINES STATUS-FLAGS STATUS-BYTE
FIELD ACTIVE-FLAG PIC X
FIELD REORDER-PT PIC 9(5) COMP-3
FIELD BIN-COUNT PIC 9(2)
ODO BIN-ENTRY BIN-COUNT 0 12
FIELD WHSE PIC X(4)
FIELD AISLE PIC 9(3)
FIELD SLOT PIC X(6)
FIELD QTY-IN-BIN PIC S9(5) COMP-3
END-ODO
END
